{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3b3abc79-0afb-860b-9bd3-15f41cf41e2b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T12:48:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. I want to report a bad spot in the road. A dip, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "113 Callender Avenue. North End. Right in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 113 Callender. What's it look like, a pothole or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a pothole. A utility crew dug a trench there last year and patched it. The patch settled. Now there's a long dip, a few inches deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so the trench cut has sunk. Is it holding water, or just low?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Holds water when it rains. Otherwise just low. Cars hit it hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, those are the ones that bounce you. Is it a through street, lots of traffic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on a bus route. Buses go over it all day. You can hear it from inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's worth noting. I'll put that in the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you add the street to the repair list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll enter it as a request for the crew to look at and get it on the list for repair. Crews go by what's been reported and what they can get to, so I'll note the bus route and the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's been looked at? I can take a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0167. And it's Mr.?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cirelli. Marco."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marco Cirelli, got it. Anything else I should put in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. I walk downtown a lot, I like going past the historic houses. Roads over there are fine. Ours just needs this one fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The downtown streets get a lot of attention. I'll make sure yours gets in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Marco. Enjoy the rest of your lunch hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T12:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
